though she’s an expert on the subject."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c21009"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/f6/f63a7026f42fb5b722e01369c7e97b0ac5fc53ed6ff6a5ac943afeb5d313755c.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/ec/ec8219e4f8f529f55e5be6ea6e35b067d11d6fff9db011bd1a8ba8365ed0abb2.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"木ノ下 やや","creatorId":"vndb:s2281","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s2281","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s2281","name":"桜木 アミサ","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:51012","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c21010","characterName":"七瀬 千春","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c21010"},"originalCharacterName":"七瀬 千春","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"bust":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"90"},"cupSize":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"G"},"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"153"},"hip":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"86"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"55"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Brotherly term of endearment: \"Onii\""},{"spoiler":false,"text":"The daughter of Souichirou and Koharu. She always smiles when they’re together."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"A lover of anime, manga, and video games, she’s abnormally close with her brother and plays with him constantly. Her high level of energy rubs off on the rest of the Nanase family."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Chiharu is inclined toward exercise, and is a member of the cheerleading squad. She eats a lot, plays a lot, and sleeps a lot, but hates to study. Unlike most of the other sisters, she doesn’t even try to hide her love for her brother."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Whenever she sees the chance, she charges right at him with a powerful tackle. She’s happy to talk about sex, and even tells dirty jokes like they’re nothing."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Chiharu is also not shy about trying to seduce her brother, no matter the time or place."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c21010"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/fc/fc24d707c2bb19f9042d5f1e4c6d0a6b386b890b64118322344135e9885c2543.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/3d/3dd7978babf9ca2551873a22890f143a7c559a366cb7f411f2ffe067dd0f8362.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"上田 朱音","creatorId":"vndb:s610","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s610","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s610","name":"眞田 朱音","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:51008","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c21011","characterName":"七瀬 しずく","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c21011"},"originalCharacterName":"七瀬 しずく","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"bust":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"88"},"cupSize":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"F"},"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"155"},"hip":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"84"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"53"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Brotherly term of endearment: \"Nii-sama\""},{"spoiler":false,"text":"The daughter of Souichirou and Michika. Her two favorite things are her brother and reading."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"The sight of her silently reading a book is beautiful enough to be compared to a painting, but the moment she opens her mouth and says something bizarre, that image is ruined."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Both unpredictable and prone to believing whatever she reads, the knowledge she picks up from one strange book or another always leads to trouble for her family."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"The ways in she expresses her love for her brother tend to be rather unique, but her affection is so earnest that she really will do anything for him. As the combined result of knowledge, training, and her natural talent, Shizuku’s sexual techniques end up surpassing all expectations."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c21011"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/36/36464723e51598b96aa6b47b3d7ac86dce8caff0f7aa98b68811f0ec3f4afe85.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/dd/dd35a189621def012415b52a0aee229f7b52caa87fb132d49d3e4bd99c24e5e2.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"鈴谷 まや","creatorId":"vndb:s987","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s987","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s987","name":"榎木 実佳","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:51011","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c36706","characterName":"七瀬 恵一","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c36706"},"originalCharacterName":"七瀬 恵一","characterNameSource":null,"role":"main","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"The son of Souichirou and Aya."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"When his parents are on an overseas trip, he is left alone with his sisters."}],"source":"vndb","